    },
    "The developer replied to or updated your feedback." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发者回复或更新了你的反馈。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The developer replied to your request" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发者回复了你的反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report, its images, files and replies will be deleted once the developer processes your request." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发者处理你的申请后，这条反馈及其图片、文件和回复都将被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report, its whole conversation and every image and file are permanently deleted, for the sender too. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这条反馈、完整对话以及所有图片和文件都将被永久删除，发送者那里也会删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The requested reports are deleted, with their images, files and replies. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "申请删除的反馈及其图片、文件和回复都将被删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The version this was reported from, which is not the version it gets fixed in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提交反馈时所用的版本，而不是修复它的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These counts cover this app only. Feedback you left in other apps is managed, and deleted, from those apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以上统计仅针对此 App。你在其他 App 中留下的反馈需在相应 App 中管理和删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app is not attaching any additional information" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 未附加任何额外信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app's feedback schema isn't set up in this CloudKit environment. If this is a production build, deploy the schema to Production in the CloudKit Dashboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 的反馈数据结构尚未在当前 CloudKit 环境中配置。如果这是正式版本，请在 CloudKit 控制台中将结构部署到生产环境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your requests, replies and reports in this app. Any votes and replies other people left on your requests go with them. Votes you cast on other people's requests stay, so their totals aren't changed. Withdraw those individually if you want them gone. Your data in other apps isn't affected; delete it from those apps. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将永久删除你在此 App 中的反馈、回复和举报，其他人在你的反馈下留下的投票和回复也会一并删除。你给别人反馈投的票会保留，以免改变其票数；如需删除，请逐条撤回。你在其他 App 中的数据不受影响，请在相应 App 中删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your requests, replies and reports in this app. Any votes and replies other people left on your requests go with them. Votes you cast on other people's requests stay, so their totals aren't changed. Withdraw those individually if you want them gone. Your private reports from this app are sent to the developer for deletion. Your data in other apps isn't affected; delete it from those apps. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将永久删除你在此 App 中的反馈、回复和举报，其他人在你的反馈下留下的投票和回复也会一并删除。你给别人反馈投的票会保留，以免改变其票数；如需删除，请逐条撤回。你在此 App 中的私密反馈会提交给开发者删除。你在其他 App 中的数据不受影响，请在相应 App 中删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your requests, replies and reports. Any votes and replies other people left on your requests go with them. Votes you cast on other people's requests stay, so their totals aren't changed. Withdraw those individually if you want them gone. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将永久删除你的反馈、回复和举报，其他人在你的反馈下留下的投票和回复也会一并删除。你给别人反馈投的票会保留，以免改变其票数；如需删除，请逐条撤回。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your requests, replies and reports. Any votes and replies other people left on your requests go with them. Votes you cast on other people's requests stay, so their totals aren't changed. Withdraw those individually if you want them gone. Your private reports are sent to the developer for deletion. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将永久删除你的反馈、回复和举报，其他人在你的反馈下留下的投票和回复也会一并删除。你给别人反馈投的票会保留，以免改变其票数；如需删除，请逐条撤回。你的私密反馈会提交给开发者删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
